{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A totally normal game about 'Rock Paper Scissors'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game plays like a <u><i>very</i> <i>normal</i></u> Rock Paper Scissors game. <br> <br><strong>Pick your choice </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing else to say here. Just pick between Rock Paper and Scissors aha.<strong> <br> <br>But FIRST, Spam some Gesture with your friend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>  </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/Gestures.gif?t=1745574232\" /><strong>  <br>   </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Hey, it seems that you're winning! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You picked Rock, and your friend picked Scissors, that's great!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But wait... you didn't win yet...<br><br><strong>So it's now time, to smash your friend </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win the quick time event to confirm the victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember that you have ALSO to be faster than your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/RPSLoad.gif?t=1745574232\" /><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>And if you win...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can finally smash your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/SmashEnd.gif?t=1745574232\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yeah, that's the general idea ahah.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1896180?t=1745574232","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/2f8b571f991f0950d7a1b9aa40659c90ae7649fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745574232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/057163c52e4f23400c67989531934b44d94dadc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745574232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/057163c52e4f23400c67989531934b44d94dadc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745574232","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violence in a comedic and exaggerated manner. Players will engage in quick-time events that result in over-the-top ragdoll physics, where characters are humorously launched across the room after being punched, kicked, slapped, or shot (without visible blood or gore). The game does not depict realistic violence, serious injury, or explicit content, but due to its goofy physical confrontations, it may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A totally normal game about 'Rock Paper Scissors'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game plays like a <u><i>very</i> <i>normal</i></u> Rock Paper Scissors game. <br> <br><strong>Pick your choice </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing else to say here. Just pick between Rock Paper and Scissors aha.<strong> <br> <br>But FIRST, Spam some Gesture with your friend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>  </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896180/extras/Gestures.gif?t=1745574232\" /><strong>  <br>   </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Hey, it seems that you're winning! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You picked Rock, and your friend picked Scissors, that's great!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But wait... you didn't win yet...<br><br><strong>So it's now time, to smash your friend </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win the quick time event to confirm the victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragr